# Tests — `test/jobs`

## Role

- Verify the job calls the right service methods with the right arguments and handles expected errors (retry, swallow, notify).

## Strategy

- Perform the job synchronously with ActiveJob test helpers per project patterns.
- Stub external effects (mailers, HTTP, third-party SDKs). Assert minimal observable effect (service method called, follow-up job enqueued).
- Happy path + representative failure when the job rescues or reports.
- Avoid real-time-dependent tests; use `travel_to` when needed.

## Clean phase

- Renamed job or changed `perform` arity: update the test; deleted job: delete the test file. Do not resurrect obsolete jobs for a green suite.
